# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOASYS-Vault — Movies ignore list (template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Silences warnings you've decided to live with. Copy to
# ignored/<drive>/movies.yaml (e.g. ignored/server/movies.yaml), uncomment what
# you need, and re-run. The real file is gitignored.
#
# Names match exactly at their level, in any category, case-insensitively. An
# entry silences EVERY warning at or below it — scan, validate and Plex. To turn
# off one kind of warning everywhere, use `checks:` in rules/movies.yaml instead.
#
# Full reference: docs/CONFIG.md → "ignored/<drive>/<type>.yaml"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# A whole category folder
# folders:
#   - Other SD

# One movie, wherever it lives. Each {edition-…} is its own name.
# movies:
#   - Luxo Jr. (1986)
#   - The Hobbit (2014) {edition-Maple Films Edit}

# One file — must name its movie folder too
# files:
#   - Blade Runner (1982)/Blade Runner (1982) {edition-Final Cut}.mp4
